{"unit_id":"yembors64632__dsh-qoder-connect#card-zh","repo":"yembors64632/dsh-qoder-connect","commit":"e7797f5b6133aad0242d8fa3746c3b0d94000375","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Qoder Connect 将 Qoder CN 订阅中的模型接入 DSH，在模型选择器注册 qoder1 provider，并通过本机 OpenAI 兼容服务连接 Qoder。它刷新模型目录、转发对话请求，并在 Web 界面显示模型倍率、额度和签到状态；支持 Web、Desktop 与 TUI profile。适合已有 Qoder CN 账号、希望在 DSH 中使用其模型的用户。使用前需自行生成并配置 Qoder PAT；PAT 过期需手动重新生成。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1780-1814","lib/index.js:1625-1693","lib/client.js:379-409"]}
